          "end": 60.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After, after you say \"Al-Salaamu \u2018Alaykum, Al-Salaamu \u2018Alaykum\", or after you finish the Salam, everybody makes Sujud?",
