        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 274.9,
          "end": 275.12,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God.",
          "start": 275.12,
          "end": 276.84,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And we have reached the conviction in our hearts that God alone possesses all power.",
