          "end": 715.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " else",
          "start": 715.82,
          "end": 716.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " follows.\"",
          "start": 716.1,
          "end": 718.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, when you give your heart to God, your spouse will love you,",
