          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " think?",
          "start": 804.56,
          "end": 804.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the Bible says what?",
      "start": 807.92,
      "end": 811.1,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " When",
          "start": 807.92,
          "end": 809.02,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 809.02,
          "end": 809.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Bible",
          "start": 809.28,
          "end": 809.72,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " says",
          "start": 809.72,
          "end": 810.0,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " what?",
          "start": 810.0,
          "end": 811.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No, it is not... it's a misunderstanding of the languages.",
      "start": 811.86,
      "end": 816.39,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " No,",
          "start": 811.86,
          "end": 812.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 812.3,
          "end": 812.3,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 812.3,
          "end": 812.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " not...",
          "start": 812.44,
          "end": 813.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it's",
          "start": 813.42,
          "end": 813.64,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 813.64,
          "end": 813.76,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " misunderstanding",
          "start": 813.76,
          "end": 814.3,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 814.3,
          "end": 814.92,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 814.92,
          "end": 815.04,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " languages.",
          "start": 815.04,
          "end": 816.39,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because Rabbi (\u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650) and rabbi, they confuse Rabb, the Lord, and rabb means father.",
      "start": 816.96,
      "end": 821.64,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Because",
          "start": 816.96,
          "end": 816.98,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Rabbi",
          "start": 816.98,
          "end": 817.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " (\u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650)",
          "start": 817.26,
          "end": 817.6,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
