        },
        {
          "word": " says",
          "start": 2110.28,
          "end": 2110.52,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"messengers.\"",
          "start": 2110.52,
          "end": 2111.6,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "However, some of these messengers may have been prophets. I don't know.",
