    },
    {
      "text": "\"They are alive at their Lord\", they forget this expression, 'Inda Rabbihim (\u0639\u0650\u0646\u062f\u064e \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u0647\u0650\u0645\u0652), at their Lord.",
