          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " what?",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I don't know from what. Wait a minute!",
