        },
        {
          "word": " farther.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We see it in Sura 53. Now, this is not... If I am theorizing, folks, don't listen to me, but I'm not theorizing.",
