          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " twenty.\"",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And he will give you things that will appeal to your religiousness, that you insisted on.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
