          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Lillah.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm gratified because it's really something he grasped it. He knew exactly what I'm talking about.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
