          "word": " still",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " paradox",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " Satan,",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " circular",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "A man"
        },
        {
          "word": " motions.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "A man"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That's fine, but this will shut him up.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " That's",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " fine,",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " but",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " will",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " shut",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " him",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " up.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no way we can go any further. Yes.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " There's",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " way",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " can",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " go",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " any",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " further.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And because we have finite minds.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " because",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " have",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " finite",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " minds.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, as he wants, he's trying to take advantage of our finite mind.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " as",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " wants,",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he's",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " trying",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " take",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " advantage",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " our",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " finite",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " mind.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We're taking advantage of his finite mind and shutting him up for it to stop.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " We're",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " taking",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " advantage",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " his",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " finite",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " mind",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " shutting",
          "start": 5430.15,
