          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " him",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " up",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " stop.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rashad,...",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Rashad,...",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But he cannot argue with this.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " he",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " cannot",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " argue",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " with",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "My question is this. I discuss with them a lot in Turkey.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " My",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " question",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " this.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " discuss",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " with",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " them",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " lot",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Turkey.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a very different way to shut them up.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " There",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " very",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " different",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " way",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " shut",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " them",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " up.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That is, I say \"who created this material, this galaxy?\"",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " That",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " is,",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " say",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"who",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " created",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " material,",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " galaxy?\"",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They say \"there is no being.\"",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " say",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"there",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " being.\"",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I say \"it is the same for my God.\"",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " say",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"it",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " same",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " my",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " God.\"",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Right.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They also have the same problem. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " also",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " have",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " same",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " problem.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Dr.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You have to say \"who created this?\" They would say Dr. Khalifa: \"There was no begetting.\"",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
      "speaker": "Edip",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " You",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " have",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " say",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"who",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " created",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " this?\"",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " They",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " would",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " say",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Dr.",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"There",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " was",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        },
        {
          "word": " begetting.\"",
          "start": 5430.15,
          "end": 5430.15,
          "speaker": "Edip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I say the same thing for my God.\" Dr. Khalifa: Yes.",
      "start": 5430.15,
      "end": 5430.15,
